arm64: Select the SPCR console on ACPI firmware

QEMU supplies ACPI tables even on its default machine. When no device tree is usable, use the build defaults for a valid BOCHS RSDP so QEMU retains its platform identity, memory window, and PCI interrupt routing. Other firmware still has to pass ACPI validation.

